= Andrés Saborit

Andrés Saborit is a PSOE politician specialized in communication and organization. He was director of the newspaper "El Socialista", leader of the Socialist Youth and held several positions in the UGT.

- @party_press
- @municipal_campaigning
- @ease_tensions
- @root: Return to main

@party_press
title: Direct Party Press
subtitle: Redirect to the Media actions.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer <= 0
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?] 
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; media_timer = 0;
go-to: media

@municipal_campaigning
title: Union-party coordination
subtitle: Reduce dissent among the unions.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer <= 0 and cultural_organizations >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: [? if cultural_organizations < 1 : The Casas del Pueblo lack funds ?] [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?]
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; besteiristas_strenght += 10;

Saborit, using his experience in municipal politics, optimizes the Casas del Pueblo, turning them into efficient machines for workers' education and electoral mobilization.

@ease_tensions
title: Ease Party Tensions
subtitle: Saborit can use the party and UGT's press to ease internal tensions.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer = 0
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?]
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; caballeristas_dissent -= 10; besteiristas_dissent -= 10; orietistas_dissent -= 10;

Through balanced editorials in 'El Socialista' and appeals to party discipline, Saborit uses his prestige to cool down factional rivalries, reminding all wings of the shared socialist objective.
